      "rationale": "Ji min bɛ da tuuri bɛ nater kan: a bɛ nater la-a-yɛlɛma ka fo o la; masinbaga-w bɛ ampaayuru sɔrɔ a lamɛnna fɛnɲɛmɛ kɔnɔ"
